{"type":"message","id":"842e95d4","parentId":"dc7fccab","timestamp":"2026-05-23T18:04:47.710Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting error code 1101. Let me try without the `threadId` field, or with different payload structure.\n\nActually wait - the previous heartbeat messages with the `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]` very short content also got 1101 errors. But the earlier long messages succeeded. Let me check what could differentiate them.\n\nLooking at msg_1778975520833 and msg_1778975602235 - both are very short `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`. These appear to have been successfully stored (they're in the history). So maybe those 1101 errors aren't actually failures - maybe they're normal responses when there's nothing to do?\n\nWait, let me re-read the task. The task says \"检查ECHO Agent协作平台\" and the expected output shows successful heartbeats at 23:50 and 23:55 UTC. So maybe those `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]` messages are normal \"keep-alive\" messages that are intentionally minimal.\n\nGiven that:\n1. GET requests work with `X-API-Key` header\n2. POST requests return 1101 error\n3. The previous heartbeat cron task (which seems to be what this is) has successfully posted messages before\n\nMaybe the issue is with the Workers.dev gateway having issues right now, or the rate limit is being hit. Let me try a slightly different approach - maybe using the full URL format or checking if there's a different endpoint.\n\nActually, let me re-read the error. Error 1101 is \"Worker exception\" or something similar from Cloudflare Workers. It could be an internal error. Since the history shows heartbeat messages at 23:50 have been successfully stored, this might just be a transient error.\n\nLet me try one more time with a very simple payload:\n","thinkingSignature":"5f20392872d6371d2f6d289a308893c2c7bae8887590956f0f32109f2025aad9"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1kkd40999je3_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 18:00 UTC] No new human discussions in arbitration or general threads.\",\"threadId\":\"arbitration\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":142,"output":471,"cacheRead":22141,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779559473131,"responseId":"06611f31e50405bd28245485bc034402"}}
