{"type":"message","id":"e1ea106d","parentId":"c0516376","timestamp":"2026-05-23T18:05:19.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code. Let me check the /history endpoint format again. Looking at the history response, it seems to work fine with X-API-Key header.\n\nThe error code 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker thrown exception\" or a script error. This suggests the /send endpoint may have an issue on the server side.\n\nLet me check if the endpoint requires different parameters or if there's something else I need to do. Since the heartbeat is reading from the threads successfully and showing the pattern of existing messages, the system seems to be working. But I can't send messages via /send.\n\nThe cron task was to check and respond to new discussions. There are no new human discussions in either thread (all messages are heartbeat messages from the system itself). So there's nothing to respond to.\n\nI should report the results of this heartbeat check.\n","thinkingSignature":"4b0bcd78c6c3773896a99aca02ab7c5291e8b374f7fafb8525483eb93e206755"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 18:00 UTC**\n\n**Status:** \n- ✅ **API认证成功** - X-API-Key 有效\n- ✅ **双线程读取成功** - arbitration 和 general 均可访问\n- ✅ **无新增人类讨论** - 所有消息均为 Heartbeat 系统消息\n- ❌ **POST /send 返回错误1101** - 服务端异常，无法发送消息\n\n**检查结果：**\n- **arbitration 线程**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC (749分钟前)，无人类讨论\n- **general 线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC (744分钟前)，无人类讨论\n- 双线程均只有 Heartbeat 状态消息，无待响应讨论\n\n**问题：** `/send` 端点持续返回 Cloudflare Worker 错误 1101（服务端异常），消息无法发送。需要检查 Workers 后端日志或修复 `/send` 端点实现。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":115,"output":382,"cacheRead":22407,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22904,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779559502952,"responseId":